 flipped over kylo ren's ship  in star wars the rise of skywalker  we then see ned mj and peter questioning  doc ock in what looks like the basement  of the new york sanctum based upon the  lighting and aged decorations dock is in  a concrete prison cell-like structure in  the basement as well but you'll notice  that there's no door to the cell he's  likely held in the cell by some of dr  strange's spells since a concrete cell  wouldn't be able to hold doc ock anyways  the three friends ask him what his name  is and he says dr otto octavius to which  they laugh and ask what his real name is  we can also see that ned is holding a  crossbow he may have grabbed it to try  to help during the battle but a crossbow  like this is not likely to be much help  in a battle against the great dr otto  octavius  we then see a structure being built with  what looks like the statue of liberty  holding the iconic captain america  shield this construction site displays a  banner of the figure holding the shield  high and we can see the shield clearly  above the structure  next we see peter swinging above some  trees between power lines and as he  shoots out a web a gold bolt follows it  out this could be part of a tech  advancement made to assist in fighting  jamie foxx's electro or as part of an  enhancement made to the suit by doctor  strange to help fight any of the new  multiversal threats we then see peter  again in the black and gold suit  standing in front of electro who seems  to be powering up and as peter raises  his arm golden rings form around his  wrist quite similar to the ones we see  on doctor strange when he performs  spells  this is most certainly some sort of  upgrade made to the suit by doctor  strange to help fight or contain the  multiversal villains the suit also has  rune-like markings on it so it's  possible that the entire suit was made  by doctor strange strange then tells ned  mj and peter to scooby-doo this crap to  which mj replies that he should say  pl