ttle between strange and peter as  peter says there has to be another way  talking about how strange says the  multiverse of villains have to die since  it's their fate  we get the iconic shot of doc grabbing  spider-man by the head with his robotic  arm and an up close look at his updated  stark tech looking plates on his robotic  arms  we again see jamie foxx's electro  fighting peter in a construction site  likely the same as the statue of liberty  captain america figure we saw earlier  but elektra looks much different from  his original appearance and the amazing  spider-man 2.  instead of having blue skin and blue  lightning now he looks much more like  the comic book version of the character  with yellow lightning shooting from his  hands and covering his face  he also seems to shoot a lightning blast  at d.gok causing him to fall off the  structure this could be because elektra  was not being cautious but i believe  it's because doc ock actually started  helping peter to find a way to keep the  sinister six alive i mean who wouldn't  want to see those two team up  next we see peter standing on top of the  statue of liberty's head and in the shot  he's still holding the box he took from  doctor strange we then finally get an  up-close look at the updated green  goblin costume as he hovers on his  glider and spider-man in his new suit we  see a figure that looks like a maskless  green goblin fly towards the camera but  it's hard to tell if this is potentially  someone else  peter and mj kiss and we see the  department of defense control surround  happy wielding guns pointed directly at  him  next we see golden rings explode out  from the statue under construction  similar to when peter botched doctor  strange's spell at the beginning of the  trailer  we see the lizard and electro squaring  off for battle against peter along with  a huge figure of sandman peter lands on  the statue of liberty's head and you can  see the giant shield in the background  the fight 